// Google Workspace: who else used these addresses in 30 days, and since when. Many
// users on one address is the organisation's network; one user is that user's own
// home or site (or an attacker), which the subject's census and device check decide.
// Placeholders: {IPS} = quoted, comma-separated list.
GSuite
| where timestamp > ago(30d)
| where tostring(ipAddress) in ({IPS})
| summarize events = count(), logins = countif(tostring(id.applicationName) == "login"),
    first = min(timestamp), last = max(timestamp)
    by ip = tostring(ipAddress), user = tolower(tostring(actor.email))
| order by ip asc, events desc
| take 1000
